        "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at main -->\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\nThis release contains bug fixes and consistently implements the `inplace` function argument instead of the `copy` argument. Functions using `copy` emit a warning when the old argument is used and internally use the conversion `inplace = not copy`. \r\n\r\n### New Features\r\n* [api] Deprecate `copy` in favor of `inplace` | Decorator by @lucas-diedrich in https://github.com/MannLabs/alphapepttools/pull/307\r\n* add layer argument to diff_exp_ebayes and diff_exp_ttest and update t… by @vbrennsteiner in https://github.com/MannLabs/alphapepttools/pull/292\r\n\r\n### API changes\r\n* [api] Deprecate `copy` in favor of `inplace` | Update functions by @lucas-diedrich in https://github.com/MannLabs/alphapepttools/pull/308\r\n\r\n### Bug fixes\r\n* commit fix to prevent nan coefficients from propagating into valid contrasts by @vbrennsteiner in https://github.com/MannLabs/alphapepttools/pull/294\r\n* [fix] pycombat copy by @lucas-diedrich in https://github.com/MannLabs/alphapepttools/pull/306\r\n* [fix] Adapt to pandas API changes  by @lucas-diedrich in https://github.com/MannLabs/alphapepttools/pull/305\r\n\r\n### Other Changes / unlabeled\r\n* [VERSION] Bump version to 0.4.1-dev0 (merge after release) by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/MannLabs/alphapepttools/pull/287\r\n* Rerun PELSA notebook with new dataset by @vbrennsteiner in https://github.com/MannLabs/alphapepttools/pull/288\r\n* add preliminary citation by @vbrennsteiner in https://github.com/MannLabs/alphapepttools/pull/289\r\n* [docs] Link the bioRxiv preprint at the top of the README by @GeorgWa in https://github.com/MannLabs/alphapepttools/pull/293\r\n* [doc] Fully comply with submission checklist  by @lucas-diedrich in https://github.com/MannLabs/alphapepttools/pull/303\r\n* [dep](deps): Bump codecov/codecov-action from 7.0.0 to 7.1.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/MannLabs/alphapepttools/pull/295\r\n* add new png and svg logo by @vbrennsteiner in https://github.com/MannLabs/alphapepttools/pull/311\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @GeorgWa made their first contribution in https://github.com/MannLabs/alphapepttools/pull/293\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/MannLabs/alphapepttools/compare/v0.4.0...v0.5.0",
